{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43505","headline":"晦日同志昆明池泛舟 · 无名氏","name":"晦日同志昆明池泛舟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵沼疑河汉，萧条见斗牛。\n烟生知岸近，水净觉天秋。\n落月低前树，清辉满去舟。\n兴因孤屿起，心爲白苹留。\n晓吹兼渔笛，闲云伴客愁。\n龙津如可上，长啸且乘流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43505.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43505","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}